{
  "_comment": [
    "Curated A18 test-point data. Hand-authored from the service manuals rather than",
    "parsed, because the printed tables need three corrections that no parser should",
    "guess at:",
    "  1. Tables 2-8/2-9 print negative rails as unsigned magnitudes ('-44 SR ... 60V'",
    "     means -60 V). Every nominal here is signed.",
    "  2. The '+30 FR2R' row of Table 2-8 is shifted one cell against 'FR2 COM', losing",
    "     its nominal. The value is taken from the +30 FR1R row, which is the same",
    "     circuit (CR7/C9 vs CR14/C18) at the same rating.",
    "  3. The +/-PA rails have no single correct voltage; what they should read depends",
    "     on which mode the supply is jumpered into, so they carry a states[] list.",
    "Signal names are transcribed from the legend boxes on schematic sheets 1 and 2.",
    "'source' on every value says where it came from; 'inferred' marks the one value",
    "the manuals do not state outright."
  ],

  "rails": {
    "OSC":     { "label": "Oscillator supplies",        "com": "TP4",   "color": "#e0b13a" },
    "LH":      { "label": "Logic/housekeeping supplies","com": "TP3",   "color": "#4fa3d1" },
    "44S":     { "label": "+/-44 S supplies",           "com": "TP22",  "color": "#8f7fd4" },
    "17S":     { "label": "+/-17 S supplies",           "com": "TP12",  "color": "#5ec2a8" },
    "FR1":     { "label": "FR1 supplies",               "com": "TP19",  "color": "#d97b5a" },
    "FR1R":    { "label": "FR1R unregulated supply",    "com": "TP16",  "color": "#c76ba8" },
    "FR2":     { "label": "FR2 supplies",               "com": "TP11",  "color": "#7fb356" },
    "PA":      { "label": "Power amplifier supplies",   "com": "TP203", "color": "#d1495b" },
    "CONTROL": { "label": "+/-PA control lines",        "com": "TP203", "color": "#9aa0a6" }
  },

